.PS
boxwid = .6; boxht = .25

Mfile: box dashed wid 3.4 ht 4.2 at (2.2, 0)
move to Mfile.nw; move down .125

Mtab: right; box "nextent"; box "max"; box "free lists"
move to Mtab.sw; move down .25

Tab: right; box "adr0"; box "used"; box "sz"; box "mark"; box "tag"
move to Tab.sw; move down .25
Tab: right; box "adr1"; box "used"; box "sz"; box "mark"; box "tag"
move to Tab.sw; move down .25
Tab: right; box "adr2"; box "used"; box "sz"; box "mark"; box "tag"
move to Tab.sw; move down .25
Tab: right; box invis "..."; box invis "..."; box invis "..."; box invis "..."; box invis "..."
move to Tab.sw; move down .25
Tab: right; box "adrN"; box "used"; box "sz"; box "mark"; box "tag"

"entity storage" at Mfile.c + (0, -0.55)

Cursor: line dashed from Mfile.w + (0.2, -1.5) right 3.0
"live storage ends: the cursor" at Cursor.c + (0, -0.18)

Base: box "base" at (0, 1.7)
Used: box "used" at (0, -0.85)

arrow from Base.e to Mfile.nw
arrow from Used.e to Cursor.w
.PE
